  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of de-Broglie wavelength of an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>-particle and a proton accelerated from rest by the same potential is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>m</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math> , the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is:",
